景和元年，出為寧朔將軍、冀州刺史，鎮歷城。泰始二年，進號輔國將軍，又進號征虜將軍。時徐州刺史薛安都同逆，上即還道固本號為徐州代之。道固不受命，遣子景微、軍主傅靈越率眾赴安都。既而為土人起義所攻，屢戰失利，閉門自守。會四方平定，上遣使宣慰，道固奉詔歸順。先是與沈文秀共引虜，虜既至，固守距之，因被圍逼。虜每進，輒為道固所摧。三年，以為都督冀青兗幽并五州諸軍事、前將軍、冀州刺史，加節，又進號平北將軍。其年，為虜所陷，被送桑乾，死於虜中。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"薛安都","kind":"person","person_id":"u3k_51j_4ul_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"徐州刺史，景微、傅靈越赴援者。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"道固","kind":"person","person_id":"23q_wcp_hny","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"此時的受命者。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0000","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"道固","kind":"person","person_id":"23q_wcp_hny","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"拒受徐州之命，遣子應薛安都。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0008","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"景微","kind":"person","person_id":"23q_wcp_hny_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"崔道固之子。此傳正文作景微。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0078","start":78,"end":81,"surface":"傅靈越","kind":"person","person_id":"kfw_r30_lgz","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"奉道固命與景微率眾赴安都。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0082","start":82,"end":83,"surface":"眾","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"景微、傅靈越所率人眾，個人未具名。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0084","start":84,"end":86,"surface":"安都","kind":"person","person_id":"u3k_51j_4ul_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"承本句前文徐州刺史薛安都。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"土人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"當地起兵者，集體未逐人具名。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0115","start":115,"end":116,"surface":"使","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"明帝所遣使者，名與人數未載。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0119","start":119,"end":121,"surface":"道固","kind":"person","person_id":"23q_wcp_hny","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"奉詔歸順者。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0129","start":129,"end":132,"surface":"沈文秀","kind":"person","person_id":"jyf_yg2_dqk_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"同卷有本傳，與崔道固共引北魏軍。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0134","start":134,"end":135,"surface":"虜","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"史書稱北魏方面，未具名將領。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0136","start":136,"end":137,"surface":"虜","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"所引北魏軍。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0143","start":143,"end":144,"surface":"之","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"指已至的北魏軍，非單一人物。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0150","start":150,"end":151,"surface":"虜","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"圍城的北魏軍。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0156","start":156,"end":158,"surface":"道固","kind":"person","person_id":"23q_wcp_hny","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"抵禦圍城魏軍者。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0203","start":203,"end":204,"surface":"虜","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"攻陷城池的北魏軍。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0214","start":214,"end":215,"surface":"虜","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"用作政權或其轄境，未具名個人。"}],"source_position":{"raw_character_offsets":[6188,6189,6190,6191,6192,6193,6194,6195,6196,6197,6198,6199,6200,6201,6202,6203,6204,6205,6206,6207,6208,6209,6210,6211,6212,6213,6214,6215,6216,6217,6218,6219,6220,6221,6222,6223,6224,6225,6226,6227,6228,6229,6230,6231,6232,6233,6234,6235,6236,6237,6238